    band: (s) => (s > 36 ? 'severe (>36)' : s >= 25 ? 'moderately severe (25–36)' : s >= 13 ? 'moderate (13–24)' : s >= 5 ? 'mild (5–12)' : 'none or minimal (<5)'),
    note: 'COWS (Clinical Opiate Withdrawal Scale, Wesson & Ling 2003), 11 items, 0–48: <5 none or minimal, 5–12 mild, 13–24 moderate, 25–36 moderately severe, >36 severe. Buprenorphine is usually started at COWS ≥8–12 (clear, at least moderate withdrawal) to avoid precipitated withdrawal; with fentanyl, consider waiting longer or using a low-dose (micro-induction) protocol. Vital signs and the observed items can be scored when the patient cannot answer.'
